abraflexi-zabbix (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Major architectural refactoring: consolidated code into Feeder class
  * Added --debug and --color flags to all scripts for enhanced JSON output
  * Added API response time monitoring with caching
  * Implemented ANSI color syntax highlighting for JSON output
  * All scripts now use centralized AbraFlexi\Zabbix\Feeder class
  * Reduced code duplication and improved maintainability

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Fri, 06 Dec 2024 02:50:00 +0100

abraflexi-zabbix (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release of comprehensive AbraFlexi Zabbix monitoring
  * Added Low Level Discovery for AbraFlexi companies/databases
  * Implemented system metrics monitoring from /status.json endpoint
  * Added network connectivity monitoring with granular error detection
  * Created immediate alerting for network, authentication, service issues
  * Implemented performance monitoring (memory, CPU, sessions, users)
  * Added company availability monitoring
  * Provided comprehensive Zabbix template with triggers
  * Added proper error handling and logging
  * Included installation and configuration documentation

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Thu, 05 Dec 2025 15:00:00 +0100
